<title>HUNGARY: HUMAN 9-MO PROFIT EXCEEDS WHOLE 1995.</title>
<headline>HUMAN 9-MO PROFIT EXCEEDS WHOLE 1995.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending</p>
<p>Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-Sept 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit     531.3	vs	519.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	 552.7	vs	496.1</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit     552.7	vs	496.1</p>
<p>    Group net sales	    9,638.9	vs   10,412.4</p>
<p>	Net domestic sales     8,738.1	vs    9,190.5</p>
<p>	Net export sales	   900.9	vs    1,222.0</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   51.6	vs	217.8</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales    6,876.3	vs    7,228.3</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales  1,997.2	vs    2,174.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   285.8	vs	685.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  26.7 profit vs	0.2 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	   69.8	vs	 86.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure     43.1	vs	 86.3</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income     5.3 loss vs	 23.5 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	2.0	vs	 13.8</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure  7.3	vs	 37.3</p>
<p>    Taxation			   0.0	vs	  0.02</p>
<p>NOTE - Human Oltoanyagtermelo es Gyogyszergyarto Rt is a</p>
<p>pharmaceuticals company.</p>
<p>The results are calculated according to Hungarian</p>
<p>Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>All figures are consolidated. However, Human did not have</p>
<p>consolidated figures for the January-September 1995 period and</p>
<p>therefore gave the January-December 1995 figures as a basis for</p>
<p>comparison.  -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
